# iOS sync shortcut

If the user's message ends with `ios` (as its own last word/token, or the entire message is just `ios`):

1. Run `npm run build:ios` from the project root (`CAPACITOR_BUILD=1 next build && npx cap sync ios`).
2. Do this after finishing any other work requested in the same message.
3. If the message is only `ios`, just run the sync — no other changes.
4. Confirm briefly when sync succeeds (e.g. "iOS production build synced.").

Do not ask for confirmation before running the sync when this shortcut is used.
